workaround:
Trong SQL Server, sử dụng Recursive CTE:
WITH Numbers AS (
    SELECT 1 AS n UNION ALL SELECT n + 1 FROM Numbers WHERE n < 10
)
SELECT n FROM Numbers OPTION (MAXRECURSION 0);

